# ── Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com  (no card needed)
# 2. In the dashboard: SQL Editor → New query → paste supabase/setup.sql → Run
# 3. Settings → API → copy the two values below into .env.local
# The site works without these (falls back to bundled data); with them,
# the catalog is live from your database.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
